{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Machinery.QDilogarithm","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Machinery.QDilogarithm","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.Finset.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Pow.Real"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.FaddeevQuantumDilogContext.faddeev_functional_equation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.FaddeevQuantumDilogContext.faddeev_functional_equation","kind":"theorem","line":131,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/QDilogarithm.lean#L131-L131","doc":"The `Φ_q` **functional equation** `(1 - z)·Φ_q(z) = Φ_q(q⁻¹ z)`\n(was `True`).  Derivation for the `k ≥ 0` product convention: the\n`k = 0` factor of `P(z) := ∏_{k≥0}(1 - q^{-k}z)` peels off as\n`P(z) = (1 - z)·P(q⁻¹ z)`, and `Φ_q = P⁻¹` inverts this to the\nstated relation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.FaddeevQuantumDilogContext.Phi","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.FaddeevQuantumDilogContext.Phi","kind":"def","line":125,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/QDilogarithm.lean#L125-L125","doc":"The compact q-dilogarithm `Φ_q(z) = ∏_{k≥0} (1 - q^{-k} z)^{-1}`\ncarried as an abstract real function of `z` (the concrete infinite\nproduct / its convergence is the open derivation). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.FaddeevQuantumDilogContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.FaddeevQuantumDilogContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":121,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/QDilogarithm.lean#L121-L121","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.FaddeevQuantumDilogContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.FaddeevQuantumDilogContext","kind":"class","line":111,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/QDilogarithm.lean#L111-L131","doc":"Conditional class axiomatising the compact quantum dilogarithm\ncontext for the Habiro element. NEAR-MATCH tier; instance not\nconstructed (requires upstream Bloch–Wigner machinery).\n\n**Legacy name.** `FaddeevQuantumDilogContext` (and the field prefix\n`faddeev_`) are retained for compatibility with existing `lean.ref`\nconsumers, but the object here is the **compact q-Pochhammer `Φ_q`**\n`∏(1−q^{-k}z)^{-1}` — **not** Faddeev's non-compact modular-double `Φ_b`\n(see `QOU.QBeta.FaddeevModularDouble` and the 2026-07-06 terminology\nruling in `docs/audits/2026-07-06-qbeta-faddeev-phi-b-modular-double-accuracy.md`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.qDilogPartial_at_q_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.qDilogPartial_at_q_zero","kind":"theorem","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/QDilogarithm.lean#L88-L96","doc":"**At q = 0**: each term `0^(n+1) / (… · …) = 0` so the sum is 0. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.qDilogPartial_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.qDilogPartial_zero","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/QDilogarithm.lean#L83-L86","doc":"**Empty sum case**: `qDilogPartial q 0 = 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.qDilogPartial","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.qDilogPartial","kind":"def","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/QDilogarithm.lean#L76-L79","doc":"Partial q-dilogarithm (truncated compact-q-dilog form). Sums from `n = 1`\nto `N`. Returns 0 when `N = 0`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}